fix: team detail unknown fields and redesign layout

Backend fixes:
- Parse created_at as string (daemon returns ISO string, not timestamp)
- Get updated_at from team directory file modification time
- Fetch agents by filtering agent list by team name
- Remove orchestrator and config fields (daemon doesn't provide them)
- Make parse_agent_summary public for reuse in team module

Frontend fixes:
- Remove status from TeamSummary type and Teams list page (not meaningful)
- Remove orchestrator and config from TeamDetail type

Team Detail page redesign:
- Same layout pattern as Agent Detail: icon+label detail rows
- Details card: Description, Agents count, Created, Updated
- Agents preview card with count badge
- Config tab shows placeholder (no editable config from daemon)

Teams list page:
- Remove Status column
